@startuml connection-zh

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #4A90D9

title 连接生命周期（续传 + 断开）

participant "Android 应用" as App
participant "远程 WebSocket\n服务器" as WS
participant "内存事件流" as ES
participant "已配对设备\n登记处" as PDR

== 连接 ==
App -> WS: 打开 WebSocket\nws://host:9000/v1/events
WS -> PDR: 验证 deviceIdentifier
PDR --> WS: 已登记

== 认证 ==
WS --> App: 认证质询

== 续传 ==
App -> WS: 从 lastSequenceNumber\n续传
WS -> ES: observeEvents(from = N)
ES --> WS: 事件流

== 事件流 ==
loop 实时
    ES -> WS: 事件 (N+1)
    WS -> App: 推送事件
    App -> App: 日志写入\n+ 投影
end

== 断开（手机关闭）==
App -> WS: WebSocket Close 帧\n(NonCancellable)
par 并发读
    WS -> WS: 从 incoming 检测到\nClose 帧
else
    ES -> WS: （流结束）
end
WS -> PDR: 撤销设备关联
WS -> WS: closeConnection()
WS -> WS: 释放连接名额

note over WS, PDR: 立即拆会话\n不等 30 秒 ping 超时

@end
